  instructions: "LEARNING OBJECTIVE: Prepare a healing spray by combining a Green Herb and a Red Herb, then use it to treat an injured patient.\n\nCONTROLS\n\u2022 GRAB (hands): reach toward an object and make a fist or pinch.\n\u2022 GRAB (controllers): squeeze the GRIP button. Let go to drop.\n\u2022 POKE: point your index finger and push into this screen.\n\nPoke this screen to begin. Your first procedure is to unlock the medical bay door."
